{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/events","html_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101","id":6176489870,"node_id":"I_kwDORtdXRM8AAAABcCXBjg","number":101,"title":"[RUST-R4] 合同资金与项目执行阶段迁移","user":{"login":"wangzishi","id":8288105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODgxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8288105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi","html_url":"https://github.com/wangzishi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-11-03T04:49:35Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T09:05:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":2,"completed":2,"percent_completed":100},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/57","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"状态：Doing / OPEN。首批37入口及#102/#103/#104/#105已收口，完整R4尚未完成。最后核验2026-11-04（Asia/Tokyo）。\n\n总体#57；依赖R3 #85已完成。R4完整范围包括合同签约与资金、项目移交/回款判断冻结、实际成本与经营、验收/完工/归档及相应内部/审批消费。90项历史阶段映射尚须在后续切片对当前controller/spec/canonical与既有Rust去重重核，不能由本批推导完整交付。\n\n- [x] R3阶段G4已交付\n- [x] 首批#102：A#103/B#104/C#105联合37入口及必要真实内部消费G4\n- [ ] 其余移交/实际成本40/经营/验收完工归档子片G4\n- [ ] R4真实生产者完整阶段闭环及独立G3/G4\n\n实施提交 [a2995dfb](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/a2995dfb187a70064d2e54ce336a72c24974721a)，归档候选提交 [17c71bac](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/17c71bac90bbeb7686fbdee5c043e58684bcb6b7)；永久S3 4f78bd48保留。[实际验收](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/validation-checkpoint57.md)、[独立G3](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/g3-independent08.json.bin)、[固定提交](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/fixed-commit09.json.bin)、[main复核](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/main-integration10.json.bin)、[原字节归档](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/archive-origin-map63.json)。\n\n验收：Rust310通过/54历史ignored，Native74套863项，Angular59套411项；必要写故障59项实命中并完整113表回滚/重试，6锁屏障及跨项目锁负例，Linux同构建续跑链/Windows完整原UI。163早期负例仅有界等价复用，原失败/partial/ignored/Native参考不升格。\n\n清理：1004自有行精确清理，3借用原件恢复；两库113表/各529原seed及catalog/ACL精确恢复、两次noop，2对象86B原字节保留、运行副本0；自有API/浏览器/Native/PG停止，卷/private保留，3作者工作树可恢复归档。\n\n本阶段和#57保持Open；后续切片必须复核归属并冻结自己的G1，再推进实现及实际消费验收。\n\n\n2026-11-04：用户授权启动第二批 #106，D/E/F原生子项 #107/#108/#109，28入口及必要内部机制；当前仅G0和联合G1输入审计，尚未准入G2。本批G4不等于完整R4，#101/#57保持Open。\n\n\n<!-- poms-r4def-g4-current-batch -->\n\n本批R4DEF（D7/E11/F12共30入口）已完成实现、验收、清理和main/归档；按独立关闭许可仅收口 #107/#108/#109 后再 #106。当前就绪治理提交 [e5f13b05](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/e5f13b05a47766a4c6a3aa13b7fc7a39799b3e76)；[归档及状态](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/e5f13b05a47766a4c6a3aa13b7fc7a39799b3e76/docs/design/rust-r4def-delivery-status.json)。Final docs/main和实际G4/Seal仍须按顺序核对，不以preclose代替末次读回。\n\n本批收口后，正式交付镜像将更新为Rust240、R4累计67/92、剩25（经营17＋验收/完工/归档8）；本次操作中的实际G4终审与Seal仍需最后核对，当前不宣称完整R4或R5完成。#101/#57始终OPEN。\n\n总体 #57 与R4父 #101 保持OPEN，原未完成清单全部保留；完整R4阶段验收、R5–R7、部署切流/性能和S3/真实lost-COMMIT-ACK未被本批认证。\n\n<!-- /poms-r4def-g4-current-batch -->\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/101/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}
